To make a schedule_candidate dispatch_ready, we need to go through many steps: create candidate, allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm preparedness, assign operator, apply operational constraint, confirm operator alignment, assign compliance certificate, verify compliance, finalize candidate after compliance validation (or finalize_candidate_direct etc) which sets dispatch_ready. Actually finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation effect: candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready. There's also finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation which also sets dispatch_ready. And finalize_candidate_direct also sets dispatch_ready.

